 one is UART, SPI (dual/quad), I2C, I2S or LIN, so the uart/i2c/spi/i2s counts all share these 6 channels.","USB is 2.0 full-speed OTG with an integrated PHY (no high-speed). The Ethernet 10/100 MAC uses MII/RMII on LQFP-144 and RMII only on LQFP-100. The XMC4800 is the same chip plus an EtherCAT slave controller.","The EBU external bus (SDRAM, NOR, SRAM; 16-bit muxed only on LQFP-100) can also drive 8080-style LCD modules. There is no QSPI flash controller; USIC quad-SPI is not memory-mapped.","pwmChannels counts 16 CCU4 slices plus 8 CCU8 slices x 2 compare channels (CCU8 also gives complementary outputs with dead time). There are also 2 POSIF encoder/hall interfaces and a 4-channel delta-sigma demodulator.","The LQFP-100 version has 24 ADC channels and 75 I/O. LQFP-144 has 32 ADC channels and 119 I/O, of which 26 (ports 14/15) are input-only analog/digital.","Both LQFP packages have an exposed die pad (7.0 x 7.0 mm incl. U-groove, 6.2 mm without) that must be soldered to VSS. The KiCad 1EP footprints listed are the closest library match; check them against Infineon's land pattern.","deepSleepUa is hibernate with the RTC running (VBAT 3.3 V), where SRAM is lost. Deep sleep with SRAM retention draws about 7 mA.","Supply is 3.3 V only (3.13-3.63 V).","ROM bootstrap loaders: ASC (UART) and CAN BSL, selected by the TCK/TMS levels at reset.","Arduino support is the XMC-for-Arduino core (KIT_XMC47_RELAX board); Zephyr has the xmc47_relax_kit board."],"sources":["https://www.infineon.com/dgdl/Infineon-XMC4700-XMC4800-DataSheet-v01_03-EN.pdf?fileId=5546d462518ffd850151908ea8db00b3","https://community.infineon.com/gfawx74859/attachments/gfawx74859/XMC/11230/1/Infineon-ReferenceManual_XMC4700_XMC4800-UM-v01_03-EN.pdf","https://www.infineon.com/part/XMC4700-F144K2048-AA","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C1337317.html","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C1343259.html","https://www.findchips.com/search/XMC4700F144K2048","https://github.com/Infineon/XMC-for-Arduino","https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/tree/main/boards/infineon/xmc47_relax_kit"],"boards":[]}